\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Jesu, Thou Joy of loving hearts,
\par Thou Fount of life, Thou Light of men,
\par From the best bliss that earth imparts
\par We turn unfilled to Thee again.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thy truth unchanged hath ever stood;
\par Thou savest those that on Thee call;
\par To them that seek Thee Thou art good,
\par To them that find Thee, all in all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. We taste Thee, O Thou living Bread,
\par And long to feast upon Thee still;
\par We drink of Thee, the fountain-head,
\par And thirst our souls from Thee to fill.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Our restless spirits yearn for Thee,
\par Where'er our changeful lot is cast;
\par Glad when Thy gracious smile we see,
\par Blest when our faith can hold Thee fast.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. O Jesus, ever with  us stay;
\par Make all our moments calm and bright;
\par Chase the dark night of sin away;
\par Shed o'er the world Thy holy light.
\par                                               Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

